  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed single-storey rear extension, by virtue of its inappropriate scale and positioning, would result in an increased sense of enclosure on the property at 30 Southland Way, which would harm the neighbours' living conditions, contrary to the Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD, and Local Plan Policies CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations), and the principles of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed single-storey rear extension, by virtue of its excessive size and scale, would fail to appear proportionate, subordinate and subservient to the host building and therefore harm the character and appearance of the site and surrounding area. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture) and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations); the Part A5 of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes SPD, and the principles of the National Planning Policy Framework."
